  <h1>Spider Farmer SF-1000 vs Mars Hydro TS-1000</h1>
</article>
<figure class="hero">
  <img src="/images/best-led-grow-lights-for-beginners.png" alt="Two LED grow light boards side by side on a shelf above lettuce seedlings, one 100 watt panel and one 150 watt panel" loading="eager" width="1344" height="768" />
